":"39:25","t":"Those before them denied, and punishment came upon them from where they did not perceive.","j":23,"h":46,"s":39,"a":25,"sd":null},{"k":"39:26","t":"So Allāh made them taste disgrace in worldly life. But the punishment of the Hereafter is greater, if they only knew.","j":23,"h":46,"s":39,"a":26,"sd":null},{"k":"39:27","t":"And We have certainly presented for the people in this Qur’ān from every [kind of] example - that they might remember.","j":23,"h":46,"s":39,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"39:28","t":"[It is] an Arabic Qur’ān, without any deviance that they might become righteous.","j":23,"h":46,"s":39,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"39:29","t":"Allāh presents an example: a man [i.e., slave] owned by quarreling partners and another belonging exclusively to one man - are they equal in comparison? Praise be to Allāh! But most of them do not know.","j":23,"h":46,"s":39,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"39:30","t":"Indeed, you are to die, and indeed, they are to die.","j":23,"h":46,"s":39,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"39:31","t":"Then indeed you, on the Day of Resurrection, before your Lord, will dispute.","j":23,"h":46,"s":39,"a":31,"sd":null}],"juz":23,"hizb":46,"surahs":[39],"sajdah":false}